sequence ask: Ask the AI for a change {
  you: You [person]
  editor: Editor
  server: Local server
  ai: Your AI CLI [cloud]
  you -> editor: Add a Linux window
  editor -> server: POST /api/ai
  server -> ai: prompt on stdin
  ai ..> server: a few ops
  server ..> editor: ops
  editor ..> you: green and red, Keep?
}
